{"id":"cre_ature","lemma":"créature","pos":"noun","rank":1809,"glosses":["a creature, a living being, especially seen as the work of the divine Creator","anything created or devised by a person","a person who is at the mercy of another, notably in whose gift his position is"],"ipa":"/kʁe.a.tyʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f3/Fr-cr%C3%A9ature.ogg/Fr-cr%C3%A9ature.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"créatures"},"formAudio":{"créatures":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-cr%C3%A9atures.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les serpents sont des créatures à sang froid.","en":"Snakes are cold-blooded creatures.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"snake","l":"serpent"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"blood"},{"g":"cold"}]},{"text":"Les êtres humains sont des créatures sociales.","en":"Human beings are social creatures.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"human","l":"humain"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"social","l":"social"}]},{"text":"Les tortues de mer sont de magnifiques créatures.","en":"Sea turtles are magnificent creatures.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"turtle or tortoise","l":"tortue"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sea"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"magnificent","l":"magnifique"},null]},{"text":"Les dragons sont des créatures imaginaires.","en":"Dragons are imaginary creatures.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"a dragon, creature","l":"dragon"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"imaginary","l":"imaginaire"}]},{"text":"Les moufettes sont des créatures affamées.","en":"Skunks are hungry critters.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"hungry","l":"affamé"}]}]}